WEBVTT

00:13:57.374 --> 00:14:01.378
One man, willing to give up his power

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.881
because he knew what he knew.

00:14:04.214 --> 00:14:06.842
That he loved his child.

00:14:07.801 --> 00:14:14.683
And he was willing to do whatever it takes
to honor the journey of another.

00:14:15.809 --> 00:14:16.977
Thank you.

00:14:17.019 --> 00:14:23.191
(Applause)